MacBook Setup - Linux Mint
Install Linux Mint with USB
Current Error: Kernel 7.0.0-44-generic
Do not reboot after install in Linux Mint desktop enviornment
sudo nano /etc/default/grub
Change the following:
  GRUB_TIMEOUT_STYLE=menu
  GRUB_TIMEOUT=10
sudo update-grub
When in boot menu:
  Advanced boot => Select 7.0... generic => Press 'e'
  Edit line beginning with 'Linux' to: intel_iommu=off radeon.runpm=0 radeon.dpm=0 radeon.si_support=1 amdgpu.si_support=0
  Press 'F10'
Should boot into desktop. If not then good luck :)

